        "The strongest platform may not be the one with the highest peak torque, most degrees of freedom, or largest AI number. It may be the one whose bearings, cables, soles, seals, battery modules, and joint cartridges survive thousands of ordinary cycles with predictable maintenance. Intelligence makes the robot capable. Anatomy makes the capability available every day.",
